{"id":4484,"name":"Grisaia: Phantom Trigger","slug":"grisaia_phantom_trigger","synopsis":"Several years after The Fruit of Grisaia...\n\nWhat was once \"Mihama Academy,\" a sanctuary for young girls, has now been transformed into a SORD (Special Organization for Research & Development) training school dedicated to fostering talent for national defense. Rena and Maki specialize in firearms, Tohka and Gumi excel at sniping, Chris handles explosives and data processing, and Murasaki is a skilled ninja for intelligence operations. Together, they take on cases too complex for the police or Self-Defense Forces, repeatedly facing dangerous missions. This is the story of these young girls, painted in blood and gunpowder.","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2025,"createdAt":"2025-01-09 02:51:08","updatedAt":"2025-01-09 02:51:08","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":11101},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17220},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":145740},{"site":"ANN","externalId":25376},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46011},{"site":"MAL","externalId":51119},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":19237}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12402,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/kCAChWmBfnuAzSIBXkd1uFBjNsUfnsOhLFA59YRS.avif"},{"id":12403,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/4bk1xsrlN8s536V06CQHnbzATYh0q1QzIFN4DWz6.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":82,"name":"Bibury Animation Studios","slug":"bibury_animation_studios"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":61,"name":"Grisaia","slug":"grisaia"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":13409,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":13343,"title":"Zero Ignition","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15684,"version":1,"episodes":"1-2, 4","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":18485,"basename":"GrisaiaPhantomTriggerTV-OP1.webm","filename":"GrisaiaPhantomTriggerTV-OP1","link":"https://v.a